# WF-014 – Visual Workflow Designer & Low-Code Studio

**Document ID:** WF-014

**Title:** Visual Workflow Designer & Low-Code Studio

**Version:** 1.0

**Status:** Draft

**Owner:** S2PNexus Architecture Team

---

# 1. Purpose

The Visual Workflow Designer enables business users, solution architects, and developers to design, simulate, validate, test, deploy, and monitor workflows without writing code.

The designer is metadata-driven and integrates with every platform service including:

- Workflow Runtime
- Policy Engine
- Assignment Engine
- Escalation Engine
- Action Engine
- AI Workflow Engine
- Metadata Engine
- Event Bus

The Workflow Designer is the primary authoring environment for S2PNexus.

---

# 2. Vision

Business users should be able to design enterprise workflows visually while developers extend the platform through reusable components.

Everything available in the runtime should be discoverable inside the designer.

