# 7. Property Inspector

Every node exposes editable properties.

Examples

- Name
- Description
- Assignment Policy
- Escalation Policy
- SLA Policy
- AI Policy
- Retry Policy
- Inputs
- Outputs
- Variables

Property editors are metadata-driven.

---

# 8. Expression Builder

Supports

- Boolean logic
- Arithmetic
- String functions
- Date functions
- Metadata lookups
- AI-assisted expression generation

Example

```
Invoice.Amount > 100000

AND

Supplier.Risk == "HIGH"
```

---

# 9. Variables

Supported scopes

- Global
- Workflow
- Stage
- Step
- Temporary
- Output

Supported types

- String
- Number
- Boolean
- Date
- JSON
- Object
- Collection

